0..50 Comment "//! `moved-twice` sends one handle to two closers."
51..54 Comment "//!"
55..120 Comment "//! The first send consumes the mover\'s slot. The checker reports"
121..161 Comment "//! `UsedAfterClose` at the second send."
162..165 Comment "//!"
166..222 Comment "//! The checker marks the spent slot at the second send."
223..270 Comment "//! The source imports `File` from `file-base`."
271..274 Comment "//!"
275..318 Comment "//! Two closers would close one descriptor."
319..378 Comment "//! - see: POSIX `close(2)` — a repeated descriptor close"
379..427 Comment "//! - see: file-base.gandr — the file protocol"
